"start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/QM8gpt4nQz"}]}, "id": "2118821838146949554", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 7967, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118809771512062227", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The Treasury spends by drawing on its TGA balance. It can’t overdraw the TGA. Nor can the Fed directly credit it. The Fed can only create reserves. To convert reserves into TGA balances the Treasury either taxes or borrows. Therefore gov’t spending requires taxing or borrowing. https://t.co/QM8gpt4nQz", "url": "https://x.com/GeorgeSelgin/status/2118821838146949554"}, {"author_id": "1643547541383057409", "created_at": "2026-11-06T21:52:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118823975170269499"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 73, "start": 67, "tag": "covid"}, {"end": 78, "start": 74, "tag": "ALP"}, {"end": 83, "start": 79, "tag": "AMA"}, {"end": 88, "start": 84, "tag": "TGA"}, {"end": 95, "start": 89, "tag": "AHPRA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/unhealthytruth…", "end": 119, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/unhealthytruth/status/2118504991434404009", "start": 96, "url": "https://t.co/VoFLIXzcC4"}]}, "id": "2118823975170269499", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118504991434404009", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "What?\nHugo died from cancer.\nWhat a pity.\nHow did that happen?💁‍♂️\n#covid #ALP #AMA #TGA #AHPRA https://t.co/VoFLIXzcC4", "url": "https://x.com/GJ4592206129943/status/2118823975170269499"}, {"author_id": "1643547541383057409", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:05:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118827175290011882"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 71, "start": 65, "tag": "covid"}, {"end": 76, "start": 72, "tag": "ALP"}, {"end": 84, "start": 77, "tag": "auspol"}, {"end": 89, "start": 85, "tag": "AMA"}, {"end": 96,